---
import Section from './Section.astro';
import { path } from '../site';
---

<Section
  id="assistants"
  eyebrow="Agentic search"
  title="Searchable by AI agents"
>
  <Fragment slot="lead">
    Every site comes with its own MCP server. Connect Claude, ChatGPT or any other agent that speaks the
    <a href="https://modelcontextprotocol.io/docs/getting-started/intro" rel="noopener">Model Context Protocol</a>,
    and it can search the collection on its own: run searches, follow similar objects, and link each answer to the
    object's page on your site.
  </Fragment>
  <p class="more"><a href={path('/docs/mcp-server/')}>Turn it on and connect an agent</a></p>
</Section>

<style>
  .more { margin: 0; }
</style>
